{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116044","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116044/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116044/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116044/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116044","id":3912571145,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7pNRkJ","number":116044,"title":"AudioStreamPlayer - `pitch_scale` introduces aliasing","user":{"login":"yankscally","id":27631913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjMxOTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27631913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally","html_url":"https://github.com/yankscally","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-08T11:29:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T08:45:43Z","closed_at":"2026-02-10T00:55:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nall versions\n\n### System information\n\nwin10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using `pitch_scale` because of the way playback rate resampling works this can introduce audible aliasing artifacts\n\nFor example at a sample rate of 44100 the Nyquist frequency is 22050\n\nWhen pitching audio upward spectral content is pushed beyond this allowed range of 22050 and without a proper band limiting filter these frequencies fold back (Nyquist reflection) into the audible range causing inharmonic distortion\n\nAdditionally the current use of linear interpolation for fractional sample positions introduces further waveform distortion generating harmonics even from simple signals like sine waves\n\nA proper solution would require band limited resampling instead of linear interpolation. \n\nIn simple terms, adding a special filter before the resample step will fix this\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nplay a sine wave and loop it (runtime/editor doesnt matter) \nmodulate `pitch_scale` down to hear crunchy aliasing. \nmodule it up to hear nasty aliasing \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"yankscally","id":27631913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjMxOTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27631913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally","html_url":"https://github.com/yankscally","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116044/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}